@startuml
title EcoBrief Bolivia - Funnel de impacto digital

skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Recolectadas" as A
rectangle "Utiles" as B
rectangle "Unicas" as C
rectangle "Candidatas IA" as D
rectangle "Briefs" as E

A --> B : filtro calidad
B --> C : deduplicacion
C --> D : ranking
D --> E : resumen IA

note right of E
Impacto estimado:
- paginas evitadas
- minutos ahorrados
- MB evitados
- llamadas IA evitadas
end note

@enduml
